  "hints": [
    "The list is already sorted. Which existing blocks can the new meeting possibly touch?",
    "Interval insertion: a single three-phase scan, no sort.",
    "Copy blocks that end at or before the new start; then while a block starts before the new end, widen the new meeting to cover it; push the new meeting; copy the rest."
